.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt MSH 1
.Os Spore
.Sh NAME
.Nm msh
.Nd run commands in the Spore shell
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl c Ar command
.Nm
.Ar script
.Sh DESCRIPTION
With no arguments,
.Nm
starts an interactive shell, reads
.Pa /etc/profile
and the user's
.Pa .profile ,
and accepts commands at the prompt.
.Fl c
runs a command string.
A script path runs commands from that file.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
msh -c 'pwd'
msh /tmp/setup.sh
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr myc 1
